            "block_content": "29.01 The Employer agrees to continue present contributions in the amount of One Dollar and Seventy Five Cents ($1.75) per month to the UFCW Local 1500 Legal Services Fund on behalf of each regular full time employee covered by the Agreement, who has completed thirty (30) days of service with the Employer. Such contributions shall begin on the first day of the calendar month next following the completion of thirty (30) days of such employment.",
